# Sync README on bot data changes

When bots are added, removed, or modified in `src/data/bots/*.ts`:

1. Update `README.md` — add/remove/edit entries under the matching category section. Each entry follows the format:
   ```
   - **[Bot Name](#slug)** by @handle — Description.
   ```
   Omit `by @handle` if no `authorHandle`. The anchor `#slug` uses the bot's slug.

2. Update `README.zh.md` — mirror the same structural changes. Keep the Chinese section headers. Bot names and descriptions stay in English (they are proper nouns / product names).

3. Keep entries sorted in the same order as they appear in the data file.

4. If a new category file is added, add a corresponding section in both READMEs.
